Version: 1.0.1
desc: Synthy McSynthface (mda)
tags: instrument
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Samples stored as 12-bit FLAC (a quarter of the download size).
  The name now shows the original plugins (mda), and the GUI credits them.
  Listed in REAPER's Instruments folder.
about:
  Four instruments in one: ePiano, JX10 (analog-style synth), DX10 (two-operator FM) and Piano,
  ported from mda-lv2 by Paul Kellett (Maxim Digital Audio) and David Robillard
  https://gitlab.com/drobilla/mda-lv2 (GPLv3+)
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
provides:
  Dependencies/SynthyMcSynthfacePiano.flac
  Dependencies/SynthyMcSynthfaceEPiano.flac

